# Campaign 1: the process group's trials before this loop (synthetic).
EXP-001 | tested | Baseline protocol | EXP-001 ran the protocol as it stood. The starting protocol, as the process group inherited it
EXP-001 | result | Kept: titre 0.51 g/L | EXP-001 gave a titre of 0.51 g/L; first valid protocol.
EXP-002 | tested | Feed set-point | EXP-002 tested Feed set-point (feed.mu_set from 0.06 to 0.3). Raise the feed set-point to 0.3 per hour to grow faster
EXP-002 | result | Discarded: titre 0.48 g/L | EXP-002 gave a titre of 0.48 g/L, against 0.51 g/L for the best before it; invalid: acetate peaked at 8.4 g/L; dissolved oxygen fell to 3.0 %; viability fell to 48.1 %.
EXP-002 | violated | Acetate overflow | EXP-002 broke the acetate guardrail: acetate peaked at 8.4 g/L.
EXP-002 | violated | Oxygen limitation | EXP-002 broke the oxygen guardrail: dissolved oxygen fell to 3.0 %.
EXP-002 | violated | Viability loss | EXP-002 broke the viability guardrail: viability fell to 48.1 %.
EXP-002 | informs | Feed set-point | EXP-002 informs Feed set-point: moving feed.mu_set from 0.06 to 0.3 gave 0.48 g/L and an invalid run (acetate peaked at 8.4 g/L; dissolved oxygen fell to 3.0 %; viability fell to 48.1 %).
